# unemu AT BIOS 1.0.2-unemu.3

The system BIOS of the open AT templates: release 1.0.2-unemu.3 of unemu-at-bios, the unemu fork of 8088_bios 1.0.2 by Sergey Kiselev, its original author. Its unemu-at build is a 32 KiB ROM at F8000h-FFFFFh for IBM 5170-class 80286 boards with two 8259s, two 8237s, an 8042 and an MC146818. Unlike upstream it resumes through the CMOS shutdown byte, answers INT 15h AH=87h and AH=88h, measures extended memory into CMOS 30h-31h, clears the memory it finds above 1 MiB on every POST and checks the CMOS as the IBM PC/AT BIOS does. It serves diskettes only; fixed disks come from an option ROM such as the XTIDE Universal BIOS. Licensed under GPL-3.0-or-later; the package includes its corresponding source archive.

